.wrangler/
node_modules/

# Release artifacts (.msi / -updater.exe) built by aimazze-app and dropped here
# to be served from https://www.aimazze.com/downloads/. Deploy-only and
# intentionally NOT source-controlled: wrangler uploads whatever is on disk
# (assets directory is ".", and .assetsignore does not exclude this folder), so
# they ship regardless of git state. Tracking them only added ~130MB of binaries
# to history and left a confusing "modified locally but shipped anyway" state.
# NOTE: a fresh clone therefore has an EMPTY downloads/ — rebuild or copy the
# installers in before deploying, or the public download links will 404.
downloads/
